  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/7/7d/Pumpkin_Pie.png/revision/latest?cb=20240207150900\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Pumpkin Pie\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\"><a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Product</a></h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/e1/Experience.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160312141717\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> Exp. lvl(s) 15</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f0/Coins.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160223180814\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 1 to 97</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>time</span><span title=\"Production/Building time\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"time\"><img alt=\"time\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/3/35/Clock.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/25?cb=20160228103426\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>  2h</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 19</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Source </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>Pie Oven</span><span title=\"Pie oven\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><a href=\"/wiki/pie-oven-3554\" title=\"Pie Oven\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Pie Oven\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span></span></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color pi-collapse pi-collapse-closed\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">+</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Default: </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"coin\"><img alt=\"coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 27</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Also: </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span>dia</span><span title=\"Diamond(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"dia\"><img alt=\"dia\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> 5</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/masteries-6459\" title=\"Masteries\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">★★★</a> </h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1 h 42 min</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Pumpkin pies</b> are <a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">products</a> unlocked at <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> level 15.\n</p><p>Like all <a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">products</a>, they are stored in the <a href=\"/wiki/barn-2652\" title=\"Barn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">barn</a>.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Making pumpkin pies</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-left show-info-icon\"> \t<a href=\"/wiki/pie-oven-3554\" title=\"Pie Oven\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Pie Oven\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a> \t<a href=\"/wiki/pie-oven-3554\" title=\"Pie Oven\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Pie Oven\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/e/eb/Pie_Oven.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/150?cb=20250925180403\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"thumbimage\" loading=\"lazy\"></a> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3APie_Oven.png\" class=\"info-icon\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">Pie Oven</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>Pumpkin pies are made in the <a href=\"/wiki/pie-oven-3554\" title=\"Pie Oven\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Pie Oven</a>.\n</p><p>To make a pie, players need the following ingredients, in the specified quantities:\n</p>\n<table>\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/pumpkin-2082\" title=\"Pumpkin\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Pumpkin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/wheat-2062\" title=\"Wheat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Wheat\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><span><a href=\"/wiki/egg-2058\" title=\"Egg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Egg\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"75\" height=\"75\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>x3</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>x2</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>x1</b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>It takes 2 hour to make a pie, and 1 hour 42 minutes in a fully <a href=\"/wiki/masteries-6459\" title=\"Masteries\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">mastered</a> oven. Each pie gives players 19 <span>xp</span><span title=\"Experience point(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"xp\"><img alt=\"xp\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> points.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Selling pumpkin pies</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-left show-info-icon\"> \t<a href=\"/wiki/roadside-shop-2677\" title=\"Roadside Shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Roadside Shop\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a> \t<a href=\"/wiki/roadside-shop-2677\" title=\"Roadside Shop\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Roadside Shop\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/0/09/Roadside_Shop.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/150?cb=20191028143054\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"thumbimage\" loading=\"lazy\"></a> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ARoadside_Shop.png\" class=\"info-icon\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">Roadside Shop</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<ul><li>Pumpkin pies can be bought or sold for a maximum price of 1,584 <span>Coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"Coin\"><img alt=\"Coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span> for 10 pies.</li>\n<li>Buying the ingredients required to make a pie costs 120 <span>Coin</span><span title=\"Coin(s)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\"><span title=\"Coin\"><img alt=\"Coin\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></span></span></span>.</li></ul>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Boat orders</b></span></h3>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-left show-info-icon\"> \t<a href=\"/wiki/boat-2675\" title=\"Boat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Boat\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a> \t<a href=\"/wiki/boat-2675\" title=\"Boat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Boat\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/2/2c/Riverboat.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/150?cb=20150712182459\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" class=\"thumbimage\" loading=\"lazy\"></a> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/media/File%3ARiverboat.png\" class=\"info-icon\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">Boat</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/boat-2675\" title=\"Boat\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Boat</a> orders ask for 3 to 4 pumpkin pies per crate, up to a total of 16 per boat.</li></ul>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Strategy tips</b></span></h3>\n<ul><li>Pumpkin pies are the only things you can make with pumpkins between level 15 and level 38. It's a good product to get some coins and master your oven.</li></ul>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Video</b></span></h3>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox video video-thumbnail xsmall\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3AThe_Hay_Day_Kitchen_Pumpkin_Pie\" title=\"The Hay Day Kitchen Pumpkin Pie (34 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"thumbnail-play-icon-container\"></span><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/5/5c/The_Hay_Day_Kitchen_Pumpkin_Pie/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20181026153402\" title=\"The Hay Day Kitchen Pumpkin Pie (34 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"104\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"The Hay Day Kitchen Pumpkin Pie (34 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"104\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"title\">The Hay Day Kitchen Pumpkin Pie</div></div></div>\n<hr>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"navtitle\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/category%2Fcategory-pie-oven-products-7560\" title=\"Category:Pie Oven Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Pie Oven Products</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<p><span><a href=\"/wiki/apple-pie-2278\" title=\"Apple Pie\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Apple Pie\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/asparagus-quiche-35814\" title=\"Asparagus Quiche\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Asparagus Quiche\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/bacon-pie-2308\" title=\"Bacon Pie\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Bacon Pie\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/carrot-pie-2089\" title=\"Carrot Pie\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Carrot Pie\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/casserole-2695\" title=\"Casserole\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Casserole\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/chocolate-pie-34691\" title=\"Chocolate Pie\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Chocolate Pie\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/eggplant-parmesan-30752\" title=\"Eggplant Parmesan\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Eggplant Parmesan\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/feta-pie-2290\" title=\"Feta Pie\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Feta Pie\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/fish-pie-5877\" title=\"Fish Pie\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Fish Pie\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/lemon-pie-10559\" title=\"Lemon Pie\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Lemon Pie\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/mushroom-pot-pie-34835\" title=\"Mushroom Pot Pie\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Mushroom Pot Pie\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/passion-fruit-pie-35185\" title=\"Passion Fruit Pie\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Passion Fruit Pie\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/peach-tart-24933\" title=\"Peach Tart\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Peach Tart\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/pumpkin-pie-2088\" title=\"Pumpkin Pie\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Pumpkin Pie\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/shepherd-s-pie-2703\" title=\"Shepherd&amp;#39;s Pie\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Shepherd&amp;#39;s Pie\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"navtitle\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/products-3603\" title=\"Products\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Products</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n</td>\n<t